I apologise for being crabby. I felt insulted that you had assumed I was 
asking for the definition of the place; I can look that up myself. I felt 
it was fairly obvious from context what was my intent, but I can see where 
there could be confusion. I also felt insulted that you felt the need to 
explain to me that rotation isn't dependent on gravity. I know this. I 
passed high school. I'm sure it was entirely unintentional, but you've come 
off as rather condescending.

I've reacted rather poorly, however, and assumed that you had some sort of 
malevolent intent. I don't imagine this is the case, and I apologise for 
reacting as though it was.

